Napolitano doesn't deny that "there is certainly a problem of resources: it is essential to invest in training and information"
The many initiatives promoted in the school sector are of particular importance for greater direct awareness on the part of young people entering the world of work.
It is of our duty, to maintain attention to this phenomenon, do not underestimate the alarm about social seriousness, apply and improve legislative standards.
